ix models when treated with this single agent PLK4 inhibitor (*p* < 0.05).\n...\nThe data showed that gemcitabine or AZD7762 alone or in combination suppressed tumor growth in two subcutaneous pancreatic PDX models.\n...\nEzetimibe as a single agent inhibited tumor growth (*p* < 0.001).", "date": "2020-05-22", "last_updated": "2026-08-27", "orig_rank": 9, "answers": {"on_target": 0.04, "evidence": 0.1567}, "jev_score": 0.0063, "jev_rank": 10, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}], "total_ms": 2906.3, "ts": "2026-10-04T12:16:26+00:00"}
{"case_id": "q031-2", "row_id": "q031", "mode": "queries", "objective": "SPR2015 in vivo single-agent monotherapy tumour growth inhibition TGI tumour regression or shrinkage in Pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) animal models", "query": "SPR2015 AsPC-1 xenograft tumour regression shrinkage", "anchors": ["SPR2015"], "search_latency_ms": 433.7, "target": "SPR2015", "ok": true, "error": null, "jev_latency_ms": 347.2, "calls": 10, "attempts": 10, "usage": {"input_tokens": 7520, "output_tokens": 360}, "cost_usd": 0.000316, "n_candidates": 10, "n_kept": 4, "abstain": false, "top_score": 0.9278, "results": [{"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "SPR2015是一种高效且选择性的KRAS G12D（ON）抑制剂，在临床前模型中...", "url": "https://www.posterkeep.com/c/aacr-2026/p/5660", "domain": "posterkeep.com", "snippet": "In mouse PDAC/NSCLC xenograft models, SPR2015 effectively inhibited tumor growth at 10 mg/kg (oral, q.d.) and achieved tumor regression at 30 mg/kg (oral, q.d.).\n...\nSPR2015 showed significantly superior efficacy in these in vivo CRC xenograft models, achieving a 64.7% objective response rate (ORR) and 94.1% disease control rate (DCR) as monotherapy.", "date": "2026-04-17", "last_updated": "2026-09-28", "orig_rank": 2, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.9467}, "jev_score": 0.9278, "jev_rank": 1, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "KRAS G12D Inhibitor's $2.13B Deal Tests Cross-Border Tech Transfer", "url": "https://www.pharmtech.com/view/kras-g12d-inhibitor-s-2-13b-deal-tests-cross-border-tech-transfer", "domain": "pharmtech.com", "snippet": "- SPR2015 functions as an ON-state molecular glue, showing nanomolar antiproliferative activity in KRAS G12D cell lines with wild-type selectivity and tumor regression in xenograft models.\n...\nSPR2015 is described as a molecular glue inhibitor that engages the ON form of the mutant protein.^1^ It showed nanomolar antiproliferative activity across multiple KRAS G12D-mutant cell lines while maintaining selectivity over wild-type cells, and it demonstrated monotherapy antitumor efficacy in cell-derived and patient-derived xenograft models.", "date": "2026-09-28", "last_updated": "2026-10-03", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.7767}, "jev_score": 0.7534, "jev_rank": 2, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "Merck Enters into Exclusive Global License Agreement ...", "url": "https://www.merck.com/news/merck-enters-into-exclusive-global-license-agreement-with-scibrunch-therapeutics-for-spr2015-an-investigational-oral-kras-g12d-on-inhibitor/", "domain": "merck.com", "snippet": "In addition, SPR2015 has demonstrated compelling antitumor efficacy as a monotherapy across multiple in vivo cell-derived and patient-derived xenograft (CDX/PDX) models, as reported in preclinical data presented at the 2026 AACR Annual Meeting.", "date": "2026-10-02", "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 3, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.72}, "jev_score": 0.7056, "jev_rank": 3, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "SPR2015: Merck Pays $400M, Up to $2.13B - novapharmanews.com", "url": "https://novapharmanews.com/apac/news/spr2015-merck-400m-2-13b-license", "domain": "novapharmanews.com", "snippet": "- SPR2015 is still preclinical.\nThe release cites nanomolar cell-line activity and tumor activity in xenograft models shown at AACR 2026, without a response rate.\n...\nIt also cites antitumor activity as a single agent in cell-derived and patient-derived xenografts, from preclinical data presented at the 2026 AACR meeting.\nNo tumor-shrinkage percentage is printed.", "date": "2026-09-29", "last_updated": "2026-10-03", "orig_rank": 1, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.6767}, "jev_score": 0.6564, "jev_rank": 4, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 10, "query_index": null, "title": "Cancer Cell", "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1535