{"case_id": "q037-3", "row_id": "q037", "mode": "queries", "objective": "IPS-06061 in vivo single-agent monotherapy tumour growth inhibition TGI tumour regression tumour shrinkage in KRAS G12D Mutant Pancreatic Ductal Adenocarcinoma animal models", "query": "IPS-06061 day 28 tumour volume AsPC-1", "anchors": ["IPS-06061"], "search_latency_ms": 1467.9, "target": "IPS-06061", "ok": true, "error": null, "jev_latency_ms": 386.1, "calls": 10, "attempts": 10, "usage": {"input_tokens": 7558, "output_tokens": 360}, "cost_usd": 0.000317, "n_candidates": 10, "n_kept": 1, "abstain": false, "top_score": 0.9089, "results": [{"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "IPS-07004 - 炎症，哮喘，帕金森病_专利 - 新药情报库 - 智慧芽", "url": "https://synapse.zhihuiya.com/drug/074cef8ac787445e84e042b3528d26df", "domain": "synapse.zhihuiya.com", "snippet": "IPS-06061 显示 AsPC-1 胰腺癌细胞中 KRAS G12D 的降解呈时间依赖性，KRAS G12D 的 DC50 <500 nM 和 Dmax >90%，而对 Caco-2 细胞中 KRAS WT 的降解没有影响。\n这些数据表明，由于 IPS -06061 诱导的蛋白质泛素化，KRAS GI2D 被成功降解。\nIPS-06061的体内药效 采用植入AsPC-1胰腺癌细胞的异种移植小鼠模型，每周两次口服IPS-06061，持续28天。\n与空白对照相比，高剂量(80mpk)治疗组中的平均肿瘤生长显着减少（TGI接近100%），且显着降低了肿瘤重量。此外，通过测量体重、食物摄入量、全血细胞计数和生化血液化学来评估毒性，IPS-06061组未观察到明显变化。\n总而言之，这些数据表明 IPS-06061 通过 CRBN-KRAS G12D-IPS-06061 三元复合物形成诱导 KRAS G12D 泛素化而显示出良好的抗癌活性。", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-02", "orig_rank": 1, "answers": {"on_target": 0.95, "evidence": 0.9567}, "jev_score": 0.9089, "jev_rank": 1, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "IPS-06061 | KRAS G12D Degrader | MedChemExpress", "url": "https://www.medchemexpress.com/ips-06061.html", "domain": "medchemexpress.com", "snippet": "Anti-infection\n...\n- Dengue Virus\n...\n- Endoplasmic Reticulum Oxidoreductase 1 (ERO1)\n...\nNeuronal Signaling\n...\n- Adrenergic Receptor\n...\n- Killer-Cell Immunoglobulin-like Receptors", "date": "2025-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-04-29", "orig_rank": 4, "answers": {"on_target": 0.78, "evidence": 0.0767}, "jev_score": 0.0598, "jev_rank": 2, "kept": false, "rea