2, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "KRAS G12D Inhibitor HRS-4642", "url": "https://www.cancerindex.io/drug/kras-g12d-inhibitor-hrs-4642", "domain": "cancerindex.io", "snippet": "Regulatory\n## Approvals (0)\nEach record names the authority, jurisdiction, indication text and status.\nA drug approved in one jurisdiction for one indication is not 'approved' in general.\nData not yet available\nNo regulatory approval recorded.\nAbsence here is not evidence of absence: only ingested jurisdictions are covered.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-19", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_target": 0.75, "evidence": 0.9467}, "jev_score": 0.71, "jev_rank": 3, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "Oral Investigational Agent Zoldonrasib Elicits Objective Responses ...", "url": "https://www.aacr.org/about-the-aacr/newsroom/news-releases/oral-investigational-agent-zoldonrasib-elicits-objective-responses-in-patients-with-kras-g12d-mutated-lung-cancer/", "domain": "aacr.org", "snippet": "CHICAGO – Patients with previously treated non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) whose tumors harbored a KRAS G12D mutation experienced clinical benefit from the oral KRAS G12D inhibitor zoldonrasib, according to results presented at the American Association for Cancer Research (AACR) Annual Meeting 2025, held April 25-30.\n...\nHowever, around 4% of NSCLC cases harbor KRAS G12D mutations, a mutation against which there are no approved targeted therapies, explained Kathryn C. Arbour, MD, an assistant attending and thoracic medical oncologist at Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center, who presented the study.\n...\nZoldonrasib is a novel RAS(ON) tri-complex inhibitor that selectively targets the G12D mutation.\n...\nThe efficacy analysis included 18 patients with NSCLC who enrolled at least eight weeks before the data cutoff.\nAmong these patients, 61% had an objective response, and 89% experienced disease control.", "date": "2025-04-27", "last_updated": "2026-10-03", "orig_rank": 2, "answers": {"on_target": 0.79, "evidence": 0.8767}, "jev_score": 0.6926, "jev_rank": 4, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "KRAS G12D inhibitor (BeiGene) - Drug Targets, Indications, Patents", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/drug/3b644c9c621b47b9bf2d8979940c903f", "domain": "synapse.patsnap.com", "snippet": "|Drug Highest PhasePreclinical|\n|First Approval Date-|\n...\nIn December 2022, the Company submitted the IND application for MRTX1133, a potent and selective KRASG12D inhibitor, which was cleared by the FDA in January 2023.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-03-04", "orig_rank": 5, "answers": {"on_target": 0.8, "evidence": 0.86}, "jev_score": 0.688, "jev_rank": 5, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "Investigational KRAS G12D Agents Demonstrate Promising ... - ILCN", "url": "https://www.ilcn.org/investigational-kras-g12d-agents-demonstrate-promising-antitumor-activity-in-non-small-cell-lung-cancer/", "domain": "ilcn.org", "snippet": "Zoldonrasib was previously granted breakthrough therapy designation by the US Food and Drug Administration (FDA) in January 2026, marking the first time this designation was granted to an investigational drug specifically targeting the RAS G12D mutation.4 The FDA’s recent designation was based on data from the monotherapy cohort of the phase 1 RMC-9805-001 clinical trial, in which zoldonrasib demonstrated encouraging antitumor activity, along with acceptable safety and tolerability.4", "date": "2026-05-26", "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 6, "answers": {"on_target": 0.77, "evidence": 0.82}, "jev_score": 0.6314, "jev_rank": 6, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "Our Pipeline - KRAS G12D inhibitor - Genentech", "url": "https://www.gene.com/medical-professionals/pipeline/kras-g12d-inhibitor", "domain": "gene.com", "snippet": "These compounds and their uses are investigational and have not been approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration.\nThis information is presented only for purposes of providing a general overview of clinical trials and should not be construed as a recommendation for use of any product for unapproved uses.", "date": "2019-12-19", "last_updated": "2026-09-28", "orig_rank": 8, "answers": {"on_target": 0.55, "evidence": 0.7933}, "jev_score": 0.4363, "jev_rank": 7, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "An overview of KRAS G12D inhibitors", "url": "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41520518/", "domain": "pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov", "snippet": "2026 Jan 6:305:118555.\ndoi: 10.1016/j.ejmech.2025.118555.", "date": "2026-01-06", "last_updated": "2026-01-16", "orig_rank": 9, "answers": {"on_target": 0.63, "evidence": 0.24}, "jev_score": 0.1512, "jev_rank": 8, "kept": false, "reason": "low_evidence"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "KRAS G12D Inhibitor Molecule Overview", "url": "https://www.lillyoncologypipeline.com/molecule/kras-g12d-inhibitor/", "domain": "lillyoncologypipeline.com", "snippet": "The safety and efficacy of the agents for uses under investigation\nhave not been established.\nPipeline molecules may not receive\nregulatory approval and become commercially available for the uses\nbeing investigated.", "date": "2024-01-17", "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 3, "answers": {"on_target": 0.41, "evidence": 0.3}, "jev_score": 0.123, "jev_rank": 9, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "KRAS G12D inhib News", "url": "https://sigma.larvol.com/moa.php?MoaId=1012573&tab=newstrac", "domain": "sigma.larvol.com", "snippet": "Whoops!\nThis page doesn’t exist or can’t be found..", "date": "2025-07-12", "last_updated": "2026-09-28", "orig_rank": 1, "answers": {"on_target": 0.25, "evidence": 0.0}, "jev_score": 0.0, "jev_rank": 10, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}]