ed the clinic as the only covalent FLT3 inhibitor in clinical development.”\n...\n•\nAnnounced FDA clearance of IND for BMF-500 in COVALENT-103, a Phase 1 study, and started enrollment of Biomea’s novel third generation investigational oral covalent inhibitor of FMS-like tyrosine kinase 3 (FLT3).", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-05-29", "orig_rank": 3, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.83}, "jev_score": 0.8051, "jev_rank": 5, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "BMF-500 - Drug Targets, Indications, Patents", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/drug/0e8fac2d50284b9fac3c91177d16d79c", "domain": "synapse.patsnap.com", "snippet": "|Active Indication Acute Myeloid Leukemia|\n...\n|Drug Highest PhasePhase 1|\n|First Approval Date-|", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-24", "orig_rank": 2, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.8067}, "jev_score": 0.7825, "jev_rank": 6, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "Biomea Fusion, Inc.", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/organization/26bae87fc714320a3f21ce8509ae5e58", "domain": "synapse.patsnap.com", "snippet": "|First Approval Ctry.\n/ Loc.-|\n|First Approval Date-|\nBMF-500\n|Target FLT3|\n|--|\n|Mechanism FLT3 inhibitors|\n|Active Org.\nBiomea Fusion, Inc.|\n|Originator Org.\nBiomea Fusion, Inc.|\n|Active Indication Acute Myeloid Leukemia|\n|Inactive Indication-|\n|Drug Highest PhasePhase 1|\n|First Approval Ctry.\n/ Loc.-|\n...\n|BMF-500 ( FLT3 )|Acute Myeloid Leukemia More|Phase 1|", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 5, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.7933}, "jev_score": 0.7695, "jev_rank": 7, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "BIOMEA FUSION, INC. Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations. (form 10-Q)", "url": "https://www.marketscreener.com/quote/stock/BIOMEA-FUSION-INC-121456063/news/BIOMEA-FU