{"case_id": "q049-1", "row_id": "q049", "mode": "queries", "objective": "ABSK131 in vivo single-agent monotherapy tumour growth inhibition TGI tumour regression or shrinkage in MTAP-Deleted KRAS G12D-Mutated Pancreatic Ductal Adenocarcinoma animal models", "query": "ABSK131 SU.86.86 monotherapy TGI", "anchors": ["ABSK131"], "search_latency_ms": 4004.1, "target": "ABSK131", "ok": true, "error": null, "jev_latency_ms": 503.6, "calls": 10, "attempts": 10, "usage": {"input_tokens": 9609, "output_tokens": 360}, "cost_usd": 0.000404, "n_candidates": 10, "n_kept": 5, "abstain": false, "top_score": 0.6598, "results": [{"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "ABSK131 / Abbisko - LARVOL DELTA", "url": "https://delta.larvol.com/Products/?ProductId=77f15c4a-7852-4271-a722-b1143fb00c80", "domain": "delta.larvol.com", "snippet": "(AACR 2026)\n...\nThe MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor ABSK131 exhibits potent activity and broad synergistic potential in MTAP-deleted cancer models\n...\n- \"ABSK131 exhibits strong anti-tumor activity in MTAP-deleted lung and pancreatic cancer models and synergizes effectively with multiple therapeutic agents.\nThese findings support the continued clinical development of ABSK131 as both a monotherapy and in combination regimens for MTAP-deleted cancers.\"\n...\nThese findings support the continued clinical development of ABSK131 as both a monotherapy and in combination regimens for MTAP-deleted cancers.\"", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-18", "orig_rank": 2, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.6733}, "jev_score": 0.6598, "jev_rank": 1, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "1", "url": "https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2025/0428/2025042800217.pdf", "domain": "www1.hkexnews.hk", "snippet": "The Group cannot guarantee that \nABSK112, ABSK131 and ABK-KRAS-1 will ultimately be successfully marketed.\n...\nABSK131 exhibits strong anti-tumor activity in MTAP-deleted lung and pancreatic cancer models and synergizes effectively with multiple therapeutic agents.\nThese findings support the continued clinical development of ABSK131 as both a monotherapy and in combination regimens for\nMTAP-deleted cancers.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2025-06-17", "orig_rank": 3, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.6733}, "jev_score": 0.6598, "jev_rank": 2, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "2025 AACR | Abbisko Therapeutics Presents Late ...", "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/2025-aacr--abbisko-therapeutics-presents-late-breaking-pre-clinical-research-results-on-absk112-egfr-exon20ins-absk131-prmt5mta-and-abk-kras-1-302439218.html", "domain": "prnewswire.com", "snippet": "Our findings establish ABSK112 as a potent, selective and CNS-penetrant HER2 inhibitor, warranting further clinical evaluation of it as a monotherapy or in combination with HER2-targeted ADCs for the treatment of HER2+ cancers with brain metastases.\n...\nTitle 3: The MTA-Cooperative PRMT5 Inhibitor ABSK131 Exhibits Potent Activity and Broad Synergistic Potential in MTAP-Deleted Cancer Models\n...\nABSK131 exhibits strong anti-tumor activity in MTAP-deleted lung and pancreatic cancer models and synergizes effectively with multiple therapeutic agents.\nThese findings support the continued clinical development of ABSK131 as both a monotherapy and in combination regimens for MTAP-deleted cancers.", "date": "2025-04-27", "last_updated": "2025-04-28", "orig_rank": 8, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.68}, "jev_score": 0.6596, "jev_rank": 3, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 10, "query_index": null, "title": "ABSK-131 - Drug Targets, Indications, Patents", "url": "https://synapse.patsnap.com/drug/b9d0045ee6cb4f9a9de977200d7ee848", "domain": "synapse.patsnap.com", "snippet": "MTA-PRMT5\n...\nMechanism\nMTA-PRMT5 inhibitors(MTA-Cooperative PRMT5 inhibitors)\n...\nActive Indication\nMethylthioadenosine phosphorylase deletion cancer\nAdvanced Malignant Solid Neoplasm\nMetastatic Solid Tumor\n...\nPhase 1\n...\nCTR20251165\nNot yet recruiting\nPhase 1\n一项评估ABSK131在MTAP缺失的晚期/转移性实体瘤患者中的安全性、耐受性、药代动力学和初步有效性的1期、首次人体、多中心、开放性研究\n...\nA Phase 1, first-in-human, multicenter, open-label study evaluating the safety, tolerability, pharmacokinetics, and preliminary efficacy of ABSK131 in patients with advanced/metastatic solid tumors with MTAP deletions\n...\nTherapeutics 2 Session Date and Time: April 28, 2025, 2:00 PM - 5:00 PM (CDT) Location: Poster Section 54 Poster Board Number: 14 Poster Number: LB240 Conclusion: Our findings establish ABSK112 as a potent, selective and CNS-penetrant HER2 inhibitor, warranting further clinical evaluation of it as a monotherapy or in combination with HER2-targeted ADCs for the treatment of HER2+ cancers with brain metastases.\n...\nTitle 3: The MTA-Cooperative PRMT5 Inhibitor ABSK131 Exhibits Potent Activity and Broad Synergistic Potential in MTAP-Deleted Cancer Models Session Category: Late-Breaking Research: Experimental and Molecular Therapeutics 4 Session Date and Time: April 30, 2025 9:00 AM - 12:00 PM (CDT) Location: Poster Section 51 Poster Board Number: 9 Poster Number: LB427 Conclusion: ABSK131 exhibits strong anti-tumor activity in MTAP-deleted lung and pancreatic cancer models and synergizes effectively with multiple therapeutic agents.\nThese findings support the continued clinical development of ABSK131 as both a monotherapy and in combination regimens for MTAP-deleted cancers.", "date": "2026-05-23", "last_updated": "2025-06-16", "orig_rank": 10, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.68}, "jev_score": 0.6596, "jev_rank": 4, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "AACR 2026 | Abbisko Therapeutics Showcases Six Research ...", "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/aacr-2026--abbisko-therapeutics-showcases-six-research-advances-highlighting-pan-kras-4th-generation-egfr-and-synthetic-lethality-approaches-302751184.html", "domain": "prnewswire.com", "snippet": "**MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor ABSK131**\nABSK131 is a potent and selective small-molecule MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor developed by Abbisko Therapeutics, targeting MTAP-deleted tumors, and is currently in clinical development.\n...\nPreclinical studies demonstrated that ABSK131 exhibits strong synergistic activity with multiple therapies:\n- **KRAS inhibitors: ** Enhanced tumor growth inhibition in KRAS-mutant, MTAP-deleted models when combined with AMG 510 or ABSK141.\n- **EGFR inhibitors: ** Improved anti-proliferative and in vivo antitumor activity in EGFR-mutant, MTAP-deleted NSCLC models when combined with osimertinib.", "date": "2026-04-22", "last_updated": "2026-09-30", "orig_rank": 5, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.6667}, "jev_score": 0.6534, "jev_rank": 5, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "Abbisko Therapeutics präsentiert sechs Forschungsfortschritte zu ...", "url": "https://de.marketscreener.com/boerse-nachrichten/abbisko-therapeutics-praesentiert-sechs-forschungsfortschritte-zu-pan-kras-egfr-der-4-generation-un-ce7f59dfd880fe27", "domain": "de.marketscreener.com", "snippet": "ABSK131 ist ein potenter und selektiver niedermolekularer MTA-kooperativer PRMT5-Inhibitor, der von Abbisko Therapeutics entwickelt wurde, auf MTAP-deletierte Tumoren abzielt und sich derzeit in der klinischen Entwicklung befindet.\n...\nPräklinische Studien zeigten, dass ABSK131 eine starke synergistische Aktivität mit mehreren Therapien aufweist: KRAS-Inhibitoren: Verstärkte Hemmung des Tumorwachstums in KRAS-mutierten, MTAP-deletierten Modellen in Kombination mit AMG 510 oder ABSK141.\nEGFR-Inhibitoren: Verbesserte antiproliferative und In-vivo-Antitumor-Aktivität in EGFR-mutierten, MTAP-deletierten NSCLC-Modellen in Kombination mit Osimertinib.\n...\nChemotherapie: Synergistische Aktivität sowohl in vitro als auch in vivo in Kombination mit Carboplatin in NSCLC-Modellen.", "date": "2026-04-23", "last_updated": "2026-05-07", "orig_rank": 9, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.6667}, "jev_score": 0.6467, "jev_rank": 6, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "[PDF] Abbisko Cayman Limited 和譽開曼有限責任公司 - HKEXnews", "url": "https://www1.hkexnews.hk/listedco/listconews/sehk/2026/0423/2026042300109.pdf", "domain": "www1.hkexnews.hk", "snippet": "MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor ABSK131\nABSK131 is a potent and selective small-molecule MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor developed by Abbisko Therapeutics, targeting MTAP-deleted tumors, and is currently in clinical development.\n...\nPreclinical studies demonstrated that ABSK131 exhibits strong synergistic activity with multiple therapies:", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-07-23", "orig_rank": 1, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.6167}, "jev_score": 0.5982, "jev_rank": 7, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "[PDF] Abbisko Cayman Limited 和譽開曼有限責任公司 - Moomoo", "url": "https://newsfile.moomoo.com/public/NN-PersistNoticeAttachment/7781/20250804/11782489-0.PDF", "domain": "newsfile.moomoo.com", "snippet": "ABSK131 is a potent and selective next-generation MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor with brain-penetrating properties.\nWe presented our preclinical research progress for ABSK131 at \n2025 American Association for Cancer Research (“2025 AACR”).\nThe US Food and Drug \nAdministration (“US FDA”) and China NMPA cleared the IND application for ABSK131 in \nDecember 2024 and March 2025, respectively.\nIn July 2025, we dosed the first patient in a phase I clinical trial of ABSK131 in patients with advanced or metastatic solid tumors with\nMTAP deficiency.\n...\nIn June 2025, we completed first patient dosing in a registrational study of irpagratinib.\nThis registrational study of irpagratinib (ABSK-011-205) is a multi-center, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical trial designed to evaluate the efficacy and safety of irpagratinib in combination with Best Supportive Care (“BSC”) versus placebo in combination with BSC, in patients with advanced or unresectable HCC who exhibit FGF19 overexpression and have previously been treated with ICIs and mTKIs.\n...\nABK131, PRMT5*MTA Inhibitor\nABSK131 is a potent and selective a next-generation MTA-cooperative and brain-penetrant PRMT5 inhibitor, discovered through leveraging our advanced computation-aided structural analysis and medicinal chemistry design.\n...\nIn July 2025, we dosed the first patient in a phase I clinical trial of ABSK131 in patients with advanced or metastatic solid tumors with\nMTAP deficiency.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2025-08-30", "orig_rank": 4, "answers": {"on_target": 0.96, "evidence": 0.57}, "jev_score": 0.5472, "jev_rank": 8, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "pan-KRAS Inhibitor(Hengrui Pharmaceutical) - Synapse", "url": "https://synapse-patsnap-com.libproxy1.nus.edu.sg/drug/284a0123f64a488db9d6a2165d766be1", "domain": "synapse-patsnap-com.libproxy1.nus.edu.sg", "snippet": "ABSK211 is a potent, highly selective, and orally bioavailable small-molecule pan-KRAS inhibitor developed by Abbisko Therapeutics.\nIt demonstrates broad inhibitory activity against multiple KRAS mutations, addressing significant unmet medical needs in KRAS-driven cancers.\nAt AACR 2026, Abbisko presented preclinical data for both monotherapy and combination strategies of ABSK211.\nMonotherapy: Broad and Potent Inhibition Across KRAS Mutations\n...\nIn preclinical studies, ABSK211 demonstrated:\nRobust\nin vitro\nactivity: ABSK211 significantly reduced cell viability across multiple KRAS alterations (including G12, G13, Q61, and WT amplification) at sub-nanomolar to nanomolar concentrations.\n...\nStrong\nin vivo\nefficacy: Oral administration induced deep tumor regression in multiple KRAS G12V xenograft models, with robust target engagement.\nBroad mutation coverage: Consistent and significant antitumor activity was observed in models harboring KRAS G12D/C/S and G13D mutations.\nThese findings support the clinical advancement of ABSK211, which is currently undergoing IND-enabling studies.\n...\nMTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor ABSK131\nABSK131 is a potent and selective small-molecule MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor developed by Abbisko Therapeutics, targeting MTAP-deleted tumors, and is currently in clinical development.\n...\nBBO-11818 demonstrates robust anti-tumor activity as monotherapy and in combination across KRAS-mutant tumor models", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-23", "orig_rank": 6, "answers": {"on_target": 0.86, "evidence": 0.58}, "jev_score": 0.4988, "jev_rank": 9, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "免费的新药情报数据库- 药品查询 - 智慧芽", "url": "https://synapse.zhihuiya.com/drug/b9d0045ee6cb4f9a9de977200d7ee848", "domain": "synapse.zhihuiya.com", "snippet": "|靶点 MTA-PRMT5|\n|作用方式 抑制剂|\n|作用机制 MTA-PRMT5 抑制剂(MTA-PRMT5复合物 抑制剂)|\n...\n|在研适应症 局部晚期恶性实体瘤甲硫腺苷磷酸化酶缺失实体瘤转移性实体瘤+ [1]|\n...\n/ Recruiting临床1期\n...\n|局部晚期恶性实体瘤|临床1期|中国|上海和誉生物医药科技有限公司|2025-07-22|\n|甲硫腺苷磷酸化酶缺失实体瘤|临床1期|中国|上海和誉生物医药科技有限公司|2025-07-11|\n|转移性实体瘤|临床申请批准|中国|上海和誉生物医药科技有限公司|2025-03-06|\n|晚期癌症|临床申请批准|美国|上海和誉生物医药科技有限公司|2024-12-03|", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-19", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_target": 0.8, "evidence": 0.59}, "jev_score": 0.472, "jev_rank": 10, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}], "total_ms": 4507.7, "ts": "2026-10-04T12:16:37+00:00"}
