0423/2026042300109.pdf", "domain": "www1.hkexnews.hk", "snippet": "Strong in vivo efficacy: Oral administration induced deep tumor regression in multiple \nKRAS G12V xenograft models, with robust target engagement.\n...\nABSK131 is a potent and selective small-molecule MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor developed by Abbisko Therapeutics, targeting MTAP-deleted tumors, and is currently in clinical development.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-07-23", "orig_rank": 5, "answers": {"on_target": 0.96, "evidence": 0.6667}, "jev_score": 0.64, "jev_rank": 5, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "Abbisko Therapeutics Unveils Six Major Cancer Research ...", "url": "https://www.minichart.com.sg/2026/04/23/abbisko-therapeutics-unveils-six-major-cancer-research-advances-at-2026-aacr-showcasing-pan-kras-4th-generation-egfr-and-synthetic-lethality-innovations/", "domain": "minichart.com.sg", "snippet": "### 4. MTA-Cooperative PRMT5 Inhibitor (ABSK131)\nABSK131 is intended for MTAP-deleted tumors (10–15% of solid tumors).\nThese deletions often co-exist with key drivers like KRAS and EGFR and are associated with poor prognosis.\n**Combination potential:**\n- Enhanced efficacy in KRAS-mutant, MTAP-deleted models when combined with AMG 510 (KRAS G12C inhibitor) or ABSK141 (KRAS G12D inhibitor).\n- Improved results in EGFR-mutant, MTAP-deleted NSCLC models when paired with osimertinib.\n- Consistent synergy in various tumor models when combined with MAT2A inhibitors (e.g., IDE397) and standard chemotherapy (carboplatin).\n**Outlook:** ABSK131 could serve as a backbone for combination therapy in precision oncology, targeting patients with MTAP deletions.", "date": "2026-04-23", "last_updated": "2026-05-05", "orig_rank": 6, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.65}, "jev_score": 0.637, "jev_rank": 6, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 10, "query_index": null, "title": "Table 1.", "url": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12562412/table/biomolecules-15-01477-t001/", "domain": "pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov", "snippet": "Demonstrated picomolar-range cytotoxicity in vitro and potent T cell-mediated tumor regression in PDAC xenografts.", "date": "2025-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-10-30", "orig_rank": 10, "answers": {"on_target": 0.89, "evidence": 0.7133}, "jev_score": 0.6348, "jev_rank": 7, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "Abbisko Therapeutics Showcases Six Research Advances Highlighting pan-KRAS, 4th Generation EGFR, and Synthetic Lethality Approaches", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/sectors/healthcare/articles/aacr-2026-abbisko-therapeutics-showcases-033700350.html", "domain": "finance.yahoo.com", "snippet": "ABSK131 is a powerful selective smallolecule M-cooperative5 inhibitor by Abb Therapeutics targeting tumors with MTAP deletion, and is currently undergoing clinical development.", "date": "2026-04-23", "last_updated": "2026-04-23", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.61}, "jev_score": 0.5917, "jev_rank": 8, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "ABSK131 / Abbisko - LARVOL DELTA", "url": "https://delta.larvol.com/Products/?ProductId=77f15c4a-7852-4271-a722-b1143fb00c80", "domain": "delta.larvol.com", "snippet": "These findings support the continued clinical development of ABSK131 as both a monotherapy and in combination regimens for MTAP-deleted cancers.\"", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-18", "orig_rank": 8, "answers": {"on_target": 0.97, "evidence": 0.6}, "jev_score": 0.582, "jev_rank": 9, "kept": false, "reason": "max_keep"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "AACR 2026 | Abbisko Therapeutics Showcases Six Research Advances Highlighting pan-KRAS, 4th Generation EGFR, and Synthetic Lethality Approaches", "url": "https://www.biospace.com/press-releases/aacr-2026-abbisko-therapeutics-showcases-six-research-advances-highlighting-pan-kras-4th-generation-egfr-an