t clinical needs.\nThe investigational product HEC234055 is an orally administered, high-activity Pan-RAS molecular glue inhibitor independently developed by the group, designed for broad-spectrum coverage of various KRAS mutations and wild-type amplifications.\nBroad-spectrum coverage and high activity: It can simultaneously act on both active (guanosine triphosphate (GTP)-bound) and inactive (GDP-bound) states of KRAS, covering multiple mutation types such as G12D, G12C, G12V, G13D, Q61H, and wild-type amplification.\n...\nSignificant in vivo efficacy: In various xenograft tumor models with KRAS mutations (covering pancreatic cancer, lung cancer, and colorectal cancer), oral administration produced dose-dependent tumor growth inhibition and even induced tumor regression.", "date": "2026-04-23", "last_updated": "2026-04-24", "orig_rank": 4, "answers": {"on_target": 0.98, "evidence": 0.6933}, "jev_score": 0.6794, "jev_rank": 2, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "Syngeneic Mouse Models for Immuno-Oncology Research", "url": "https://medicilon.com/in-vivo-models/syngeneic-mouse-models/", "domain": "medicilon.com", "snippet": "Provide an immunocompetent, genetically consistent model for tumor immunology and cancer immunotherapy research.", "date": "2025-11-20", "last_updated": "2026-09-27", "orig_rank": 9, "answers": {"on_target": 0.05, "evidence": 0.2433}, "jev_score": 0.0122, "jev_rank": 3, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "Syngeneic Models", "url": "https://biocytogen.com/product/syngeneic-models", "domain": "biocytogen.com", "snippet": "Syngeneic models, where tumors are transplanted into immunocompetent mice of the same genetic background, enable the study of tumor-immune interactions and the evaluation of immunotherapies in a functional immune system.\n...\n|B-hJAM3 MC38|322013|C57BL/6|", "date": "2024-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-07-21", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_t