ion through study-ready cohorts.", "date": "2026-10-01", "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 10, "answers": {"on_target": 0.04, "evidence": 0.1467}, "jev_score": 0.0059, "jev_rank": 3, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "Mouse Model Generation & Catalog | 14,774+ Lines", "url": "https://www.genetargeting.com/", "domain": "genetargeting.com", "snippet": "Ingenious targeting laboratory generates mouse models including conventional knockouts, conditional knockouts (floxed alleles), knockins (point mutations, cDNA, gene replacement, reporters), Rosa26 and other targeted transgenics, and humanized models.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_target": 0.05, "evidence": 0.08}, "jev_score": 0.004, "jev_rank": 4, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "Genetically Engineered Mouse Models", "url": "https://www.gempharmatech.com/animal-models/genetically-engineered-models", "domain": "gempharmatech.com", "snippet": "Browse our comprehensive catalog of over 30,000 mouse models covering various gene families, signaling pathways, and disease models.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-24", "orig_rank": 9, "answers": {"on_target": 0.05, "evidence": 0.0467}, "jev_score": 0.0023, "jev_rank": 5, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "Find Your Research Mouse Model 丨 GemPharmatech", "url": "https://en.gempharmatech.com/product/search_608.html", "domain": "en.gempharmatech.com", "snippet": "|Bmp8b-flox|T026616|C57BL/6JGpt-*Bmp8b^em1Cflox^*/Gpt| |Details+|", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-05-19", "orig_rank": 1, "answers": {"on_target": 0.04, "evidence": 0.0433}, "jev_score": 0.0017, "jev_rank": 6, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "MMRRC Repository", "url": "https://www.mmrrc.org/", "domain": "mmrrc.org", "snippet": "These mice, especially the 5XFAD strain, are valuable for modeling Alzheimer's disease, allowing researchers to closely examine how AD pathology develops.\n...\nIn groundbreaking research, scientists have elucidated the effects of neuroinflammation on brain metabolism in Alzheimer's disease using the APPswe/PS1dE9 mouse model (MMRRC Strain # 034829).", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-10-03", "orig_rank": 5, "answers": {"on_target": 0.02, "evidence": 0.0467}, "jev_score": 0.0009, "jev_rank": 7, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "International Mouse Strain Resource", "url": "https://www.findmice.org/", "domain": "findmice.org", "snippet": "The IMSR is a searchable online database of mouse strains, stocks, and mutant ES cell lines available worldwide, including inbred, mutant, and genetically engineered strains.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 2, "answers": {"on_target": 0.03, "evidence": 0.0233}, "jev_score": 0.0007, "jev_rank": 8, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "Cyagen Mouse Model Library | Humanized & Disease Models", "url": "https://www.cyagen.com/mouseatlas", "domain": "cyagen.com", "snippet": "Cyagen’s Premier Mouse Model Library Access a comprehensive mouse model catalog of 20,000+ ready-to-use strains.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_rank": 8, "answers": {"on_target": 0.04, "evidence": 0.0167}, "jev_score": 0.0007, "jev_rank": 9, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "All Catalog Mouse Models - Ingenious targeting laboratory", "url": "https://www.genetargeting.com/all-catalog-mouse-models/", "domain": "genetargeting.com", "snippet": "Search our extensive catalog of over 14,774 genetically engineered mouse models including knockout, knockin, humanized, Cre driver, and reporter strains for biomedical research and drug development.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-10-02", "orig_ra